      "line": 59,
      "title": "Apply the 2023 securities acquisition boundary and FIFO before calculating gains",
      "source": "https://www.ujp.gov.mk/files/attachment/0000/1466/ZAKON_ZA_DANOKOT_NA_LICEN_DOHOD_-_Azuriran_so_Sl.vesnik____274___od_20.12.2022.pdf",
      "provision": "Gazette 274/2022 amending Act, transitional arts.21-22, consolidated PDF pp.38-39",
      "problem": "The ordinary capital-gains instructions include securities/fund units without the statutory acquisition-date boundary and do not specify FIFO. Applying the paragraph to a 2026 sale of pre-2023 acquired securities can tax an excluded acquisition; using a chosen/average lot instead of FIFO changes the taxable gain. The acquisition date of the predecessor also matters for gifts/inheritances.",
      "fix": "Add the 1 January 2023 acquisition boundary, including predecessor acquisitions, and chronological oldest-to-newest FIFO for the covered securities/fund calculation. Make the lot-acquisition history an intake fact. Route the cross-border guide to the same rule.",
      "requires_closure": true
    },
    {
