      "provision": "PIT art.27(7), PDF p.11",
      "problem": "The base says to add back excessive loan interest but omits the expressly prescribed fallback when the taxpayer cannot document the bank-comparable rate. The TP sole-trader paragraph does not supply it either. A preparer otherwise cannot determine the deductible ceiling in an ordinary undocumented-comparator case.",
